  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/P1630627.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(36 fotos) Aquest migdia ha comen&ccedil;at a l&#39;avinguda de la Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave; d&#39;Onda el cicle de Teatre d&#39;Estiu amb l&#39;obra &#39;Recicla con Limpilla y Basurilla&#39;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/P1630649.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>L&#39;&agrave;rea de Cultura de l&#39;Ajuntament ha preparat un nou muntage la vesprada d&#39;aquest dissabte, a les 19.30 hores, al Parc de la Cer&agrave;mica, On estan els monstres?</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/basurillalimpillateatreestiu080717/p1630616.jpg\" alt=\"p1630616\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/basurillalimpillateatreestiu080717/p1630617.jpg\" alt=\"p1630617\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/basurillalimpillateatreestiu080717/p1630618.jpg\" alt=\"p1630618\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/basurillalimpillateatreestiu080717/p1630619.jpg\" alt=\"p1630619\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/basurillalimpillateatreestiu080717/p1630620.jpg\" alt=\"p1630620\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/basurillalimpillateatreestiu080717/p1630621.jpg\" alt=\"p1630621\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/basurillalimpillateatreestiu080717/p1630623.jpg\" alt=\"p1630623\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-9